ting the superior aspect of the specimen  The anterior resection margin is inked blue and the posterior is inked black  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 1cm irregular tan white indurated area  tumor bed   which includes a biopsy site and is located in the upper inner quadrant of the breast  1 4cm from the closest posterior and 0 8cm from the closest anterior margin  The remaining breast parenchyma is grossly unremarkable and no lesions are identified  Within the axillary tail  15 lymph nodes are identified  Sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   4 5cm indurated area  tumor bed   entirely submitted  with surrounding parenchyma and closest resection margins   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of the lower inner breast quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of the upper outer breast quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of the lower outer breast quadrant  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   1 lymph node  bisected   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   14 lymph nodes  Final Diagnosis by Adriana Dionigi Corben M D   Electronically signed on Friday REMOVED_MONTH 13   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 06 17 30PM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  PART   Breast  Left   Modified Radical Mastectomy  report_end  , Periareolar.
